":"question","type":"text","value":"[问题1]空间的两个平面有哪些位置关系？","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L053:para16:planes-room-context:0"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"生:平面与平面的位置关系只有两种：平行或相交．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L053:para17:planes-room-context:1"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"师:很好，该同学的回答是正确的，两个平面平行或相交.这两种位置关系在我们学习第10.1节介绍公理3时有所提及．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L053:para18:planes-room-context:2"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"如果两个平面没有公共点，则这两个平面平行；如果两个平面有公共点，根据公理3，这两个平面相交于一条公共直线，即两个平面相交．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L053:para19:planes-room-context:3"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"比如我们把教室抽象成一个长方体，教室中左右两侧的墙面所在平面平行；而墙面与地面所在平面相交．                        ","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L053:para20:planes-room-context:4"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"今天我们重点研究平面与平面平行的相关问题．我们先来研究一下如何判定两个平面平行．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L053:para21:planes-room-context:5"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"目前我们仅能通过两个平面平行的定义，即两个平面没有公共点说明这两个平面平行，但这个方法在实际生活中不便于操作，比如我们要判断教室天花板与地面所在平面是否平行，我们很难判断两个平面是否没有公共点，所以我们要寻求新的方法．","evidenceIds":["ev:book3:L053:para22:planes-room-context:6"]}],"matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"该具体任务与既有节点对应"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book3:L053:para16:planes-room-context:0","sourceId":"L053","sourceSha256":"e16806b1666c58e68fef0430c0c51189a8ecae2b6b1f2b7f5d0a1557982eb2e3","locator":{"headingPath":["教室墙面与地面引入平面位置关系"],"part":"word/document.xml","paragraphIndex":16,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":2,"printedPage":2,"pdfPage":2,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"[问题1]空间的两个平面有哪些位置关系？","quoteRepresentation":"native_xml_text_verbatim","quoteCompleteness":"原XML文字层逐字拼接。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":null,"sourceId":"L053","requestedPath":"increments/u05-u08-l041-l054-v2/evidence/L053/page-2.png","kind":"missing_source_page","sha256":null,"bytes":null},"originalUrl":"source-original/L053.docx","sourceTitle":"10.